{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","毁灭之斧"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","파멸의 도끼"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击倒单名敌人并降低其护甲。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 1명을 넘어뜨리고 물리 방어력을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人进行强力斩击，击倒目标1.5秒，对目标造成450% + 50% ATK伤害并施加3层“碎甲”效果。每1层“碎甲”会使目标护甲降低10%，每个目标最多叠加4层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 강력한 참격을 가하여 1.5초간 넘어뜨리며, 목표에게 450% + 50% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 방어무시 효과를 3스택 부여한다. 방어무시 1스택 당 목표의 물리 방어력을 10% 감소시킨다(목표당 최대 4스택 중첩 가능)."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当克鲁格在场时，友军在降低敌方单位护甲的同时会额外施加1层“碎甲”效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","크루거가 전장에 있고, 아군이 적 유닛의 물리 방어력을 감소시킬 때, 방어무시 효과를 1스택 추가로 부여한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至465% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 465% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 480% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 500% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","破碎挥击"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","분쇄의 일격"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","攻击敌人并降低其护甲。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","적을 공격하고 물리 방어력을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","挥砍一名敌人，造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并施加1层“碎甲”效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","적 1명을 베어 240% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 방어무시 효과를 1스택 부여한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 260% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 280% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 300% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","要害打击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","급소 타격"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","附近有敌人护甲较低时，对其造成伤害并使其获得“暴露要害”，提升受到的物理伤害与克鲁格对其的生命汲取。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","주변에 물리 방어력이 낮은 적이 있으면 해당 적에게 대미지를 입히고 급소 노출 효과를 부여하여, 받는 물리 대미지를 증가시키고, 크루거의 생명 흡수를 증가시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若附近敌军的“碎甲”层数不小于4层且没有“暴露要害”时，重击该目标，对其造成400% + 50% ATK伤害并使目标“暴露要害”。“暴露要害”的目标所受的物理伤害提升40%。当克鲁格对“暴露要害”的目标造成伤害时恢复相当于伤害量40%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","주변 적군의 방어무시 중첩수가 4스택 이상이며 급소 노출이 없을 때, 해당 목표를 강타하여 400% + 50% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 목표에게 급소 노출 효과를 부여한다. 급소 노출의 목표가 받는 물리 대미지가 40% 증가한다. 크루거가 급소 노출 상태의 목표에게 대미지를 입히면 대미지량의 40%에 해당하는 HP를 회복한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 440% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 480% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 520% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身远程防御。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 원거리 방어가 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 원거리 방어가 16 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 원거리 방어가 21 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升26点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 원거리 방어가 26 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","孤胆独行"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","고군분투"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若附近没有友军，则获得护盾。战斗中，若附近没有友军，则提升生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 시 주변에 아군이 없으면 실드를 획득한다. 전투 중 주변에 아군이 없으면 생명 흡수가 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，如果周围1格内没有友军，则获得可抵御40% HP伤害的护盾，持续15秒，护盾存在期间免控。战斗中，如果周围1格内没有友军，克鲁格增加30点生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 시 주변 1칸 내에 아군이 없으면 40% HP의 대미지를 막을 수 있는 실드를 15초간 획득하여, 실드 보유 기간 제어에 면역된다. 전투 중 주변 1칸 내에 아군이 없으면 크루거는 생명 흡수가 30 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":25,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至44% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 44% HP로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“要害打击”不再有距离限制（其他限制不变），克鲁格可以冲向符合条件敌人，并释放“要害打击”。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","급소 타격의 거리 제한(기타 제한 변경 없음)이 사라지며, 크루거는 조건에 맞는 적에게 돌진하여 급소 타격을 시전할 수 있다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至48% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 48% HP로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力永久提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","급소 노출을 받은 적군이 사망 시, 크루거의 공격력이 영구 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当技能“要害打击”造成“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力提升40%，该效果最多可叠加2次，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","급소 타격으로 급소 노출을 입혀 적군 처치 시, 크루거의 공격력이 40% 증가하며(최대 2스택 중첩 가능), 전투가 끝날 때까지 지속된다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛮石战斧"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","암석 도끼"]]}